@startuml
title State Diagram — HU2: Schedule Configuration (Administrator ↔ System messages)

' Refines the context-state SCHEDULE_CONFIGURATION (HU2).
' Actors: Business Administrator (authenticated) <-> System.

state "SCHEDULE_PANEL\n(authenticated admin)" as panel
state "DEFINING_WORKDAY\n(days, hours, break)" as defining
state "RULES_SAVED\n(availability engine updated)" as saved

[*] --> panel : Admin→System: openSchedulePanel

panel --> defining : Admin→System: defineDaysAndHours(Mon-Fri 09:00-18:00, break 14:00-15:00)

defining --> saved : Admin→System: saveChanges\n/ System: persistRules(tenant_id), updateAvailabilityEngine
saved --> panel : System→Admin: confirmSaved

saved --> defining : Admin→System: modifySchedule(closing 18:00→17:00)

saved --> [*] : Admin→System: closePanel

note right of saved
  Non-working day (e.g. Saturday):
  the engine offers no bookable slots.
  Already confirmed appointments are not altered.
end note
@enduml
